            "review_title": "Review at Ringer Hut",
            "review_text": "Klondyke B\nPoynton, United Kingdom8 contributions\n0\nHighly recommend\nFeb 2020 • Solo\nFound this restaurant while walking around.its in an clean and cool enviroment you can watch the meals being cooked.i had a really nice beef rice meal.cheep and very tasty.will be coming back.\nGood.staff.good food and easy price youd be silly to pass this place by\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 11, 2020",
